hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27607","Haddathana Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi, he said: Haddathani Kharijah ibn al-Harith al-Muzani, he said: Haddathani Salim ibn Sarj, he said: I heard Umm Subayyah al-Juhaniyyah saying: My hand and the hand of the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, would alternate in ablution from a single vessel."
"27608","Haddathana Yahya ibn Sa'id, from Usamah ibn Yazid, he said: Haddathani Salim Abu al-Nu'man, from Umm Subayyah, she said: My hand and the hand of the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, would alternate in a single vessel in ablution."
